Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 085] panvk: keep the descriptor ring and VkEvent syncs in CSF event memory

Generated-by: LLM

Purpose: Move the render descriptor ringbuf sync and VkEvent sync words into CSF event memory, and signal KBASE_IOCTL_CS_EVENT_SIGNAL after a host SetEvent/ResetEvent so an evicted CSG is resumed; biblioklept
